

1. Opus – AI-powered video creation and editing tool that helps users generate and enhance videos quickly with automation and AI-driven features.


2. Runway – A creative AI platform offering video editing, AI-generated content, and real-time collaboration tools, often used for advanced video generation and special effects.


3. HeyGen – AI-driven video generation tool that enables users to create professional-looking videos with avatars, text-to-video capabilities, and voice cloning.


4. InVideo – Online video editing and creation platform with pre-made templates, stock footage, and AI-powered tools to streamline content production for social media, marketing, and business.


5. Klap – AI-powered short-form video editing tool designed to repurpose longer videos into engaging clips optimized for platforms like TikTok, YouTube Shorts, and Instagram Reels.


6. Eightify – AI-powered summarization tool that generates concise summaries of YouTube videos, allowing users to quickly grasp key points without watching the full content.


